# One app at a time

When more than one app is in the workspace, change only the app Michael asked about.

- Do not edit, deploy, or otherwise change a second app in the same turn.
- If the task needs the other app, finish the requested app and say what is left for a later turn.
- LocalFind and Daybook are separate apps.
